/**
 * Unit tests for `inflate()` from
 * packages/imba/polyfills/zlib/zlib-lib/inflate.js
 *
 * The polyfill is authored using ES module syntax while this Jest project runs
 * test files as CommonJS (the closest package.json does not declare
 * `"type": "module"`, and Jest 30 refuses to treat `.js` as ESM). To exercise
